my Winged Dragon of Rockhorn.

217
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:57,780
I'm afraid there's no way it can stop me.

218
00:13:58,040 --> 00:14:01,180
And once I defeat you,
Obelisk will be in my deck.

219
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,640
And I haven't forgotten you, Yugi.

220
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:07,837
Your Egyptian God card and Millennium
Puzzle will be mine as well.

221
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:10,020
And since my rare hunters failed,

222
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:13,557
