241
00:15:17,620 --> 00:15:18,660
What a fool!

242
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,480
Let him go!

243
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:21,850
Stop!

244
00:15:21,933 --> 00:15:23,177
You're wasting your energy, Kaiba!

245
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:27,037
He obviously has no intention of
helping us find Mokuba and the others!

246
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,460
Very perceptive!

247
00:15:33,380 --> 00:15:34,220
He's gone.

248
00:15:34,940 --> 00:15:39,037
All right, then we're going to have
to track them down on our own, Kaiba.

249
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:41,296
Maybe your satellite system can help.

250
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:43,424
Look, Yugi, first things first.

251
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:46,229
I think this rare hunter
owes us something.

252
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:53,560
This was an official Battle City duel.

253
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:58,452
That means the losers have to give up
one locator card each to the winners.

254
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:00,280
There's one for each of us.

255
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:02,700
That means we both have six.

256
00:16:02,980 --> 00:16:06,740
We're each guaranteed a spot
in the Battle City Finals now.

257
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:11,197
Kaiba, how can you begin to think about
the tournament after what Marik just said?

258
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:15,020
We have to find my friends
and your brother right now.

259
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,960
I'm well aware of that, Yugi.

260
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:20,346
Then help me think of a plan.

261
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:21,856
Every second counts.

262
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:28,600
Isn't that one of your helicopters, Kaiba?

263
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:33,280
It's Mokuba! He escaped!

264
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,800
Tell me, are you all right?

265
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:42,554
Mm-hmm, but I had to leave Taya behind.

266
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,580
Is Taya okay?

267
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,802
And what about Joey and Tristan?

268
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,860
Well, I'm not so sure
about Joey or Tristan,

269
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:52,097
but up until she helped me
escape from the rare hunters,

270
00:16:52,180 --> 00:16:53,557
Taya was doing all right.

271
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:55,000
We gotta go back there!

272
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,553
Get in the chopper now!

273
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:59,137
Sounds like your friend
Taya saved Mokuba's

274
00:16:59,220 --> 00:17:01,437
life And as much as I
hate getting involved,

275
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:04,520
I hate owing someone a
favor even more. Thank you.

276
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,680
This is Jefferson Station.

277
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:11,864
Take all of your belongings
and watch your step.

278
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:14,193
I need something to go.

279
00:17:14,340 --> 00:17:15,170
Quickly, please.

280
00:17:15,253 --> 00:17:17,017
It'll help me if you
tell me what you'd like.

281
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:18,180
Uh, I don't know.

282
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:19,597
Just give me one of everything.

283
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:20,510
What?

284
00:17:20,593 --> 00:17:22,157
Come on, less yakking and more packing.

285
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:23,593
I got a train to catch.

286
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:25,800
All aboard.

287
00:17:26,220 --> 00:17:28,277
Step in and stand clear
of the closing doors.

288
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:30,660
Next stop, Town of Domino.

289
00:17:31,740 --> 00:17:33,420
Oh, no, where's Tristan?

290
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:35,582
I hope he didn't miss the train.

291
00:17:35,940 --> 00:17:37,060
Guess who's back?

292
00:17:37,340 --> 00:17:40,097
Hope you like food, because
I just brought back plenty.

293
00:17:40,180 --> 00:17:42,277
How about a cheeseburger and french fries?

294
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:45,840
Come on, burrito supreme,
macaroni and cheese, sushi, what?

295
00:17:49,460 --> 00:17:50,400
Excuse me.

296
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,510
Tristan?

297
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:53,960
What is it, Serenity?

298
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:58,437
Well, I'm still nervous about what'll
happen when I take my bandages off.

299
00:17:58,520 --> 00:18:01,357
I know that the doctor said
I can take them off tonight,

300
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:03,911
but I'm worried the operation didn't work.

301
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:06,848
Nah, you're going to
be just fine, Serenity.

302
00:18:06,940 --> 00:18:09,397
You got to have a little
faith, that's all.

303
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:12,097
I know, but I want to
see so badly, Tristan,

304
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:15,617
and there's a part of me that's
too frightened to face this alone.

305
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:19,277
I bet you'd think I'm just acting
like a scared little baby, huh?

306
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:22,757
Come on, we all get scared
sometimes, but if you think about it,

307
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:26,237
the things that seem to freak us out
the most are usually no big deal at all,

308
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:27,320
Serenity. Yeah,

309
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:30,237
and I think I'll feel better
once we get to Battle City and

310
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:33,717
find Joey Because I need him
to give me the courage and the

311
00:18:33,800 --> 00:18:36,497
strength to face the unknown
one more time Like he did when

312
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:39,457
I first went to the hospital
And I'll tell you something,

313
00:18:39,540 --> 00:18:43,422
I think Joey needs you right now
just as much as you need him Huh?

314
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:47,740
You'll give him the courage
he needs to win the finals Ah,

315
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:51,697
that's so perfect We'll
inspire each other and together

316
00:18:51,780 --> 00:18:55,277
we'll both overcome our doubts
Thanks for listening to me,

317
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:57,897
Tristan and I can't wait
till we get to Battle City.

318
00:18:57,980 --> 00:18:59,800
No sweat. Don't mention it.

319
00:19:02,260 --> 00:19:04,672
Is our satellite tracking system working?

320
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:06,210
Yes.

321
00:19:06,293 --> 00:19:08,697
I'm picking up a weak signal
from Joey's tool disc.

322
00:19:08,780 --> 00:19:12,417
It's coming from the same spot where those
rare hunters were keeping me and Taya.

323
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:14,794
We should be there in about 15 minutes.

324
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,706
Joey and Taya better be okay.

325
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,197
Hang in there, guys.

326
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:19,986
We're on our way to save you.

327
00:19:34,280 --> 00:19:36,560
Yo, yo, yo, he's a baby

328
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:00,460
Your love

329
00:20:04,840 --> 00:20:06,157
Yo, yo, yo, yo,

330
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,357
he's a baby Yo,

331
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:14,440
yo,

332
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,510
yo, yo
